### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books

### Get book by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/1

### Get book by ID (not found)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/999

### Filter books by genre
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books?genre=fantasy

### Filter books by year
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books?year=1949

### Filter books by genre and year
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books?genre=fantasy&year=1937

### Search books by title
GET http://localhost:3000/api/books/search?title=node

### Create a new book
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Node.js Design Patterns",
    "authorId": 3,
    "genre": "programming",
    "year": 2020
}

### Create a new book (missing required field)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Test Book"
}

### Create a new book (author not found)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Bad Book",
    "authorId": 999,
    "genre": "test",
    "year": 2023
}

### Update a book
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "year": 1938
}

### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:3000/api/books/5

### Get all authors
GET http://localhost:3000/api/authors

### Get author by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/api/authors/1

### Get books by author
GET http://localhost:3000/api/authors/1/books

### Get statistics
GET http://localhost:3000/api/statistics

### Unknown route
GET http://localhost:3000/api/unknown
